  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1607.05 Portable Toilet and Marine Sanitation Device Deodorants and Disinfectants",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1607.05 Portable Toilet and Marine Sanitation Device Deodorants and Disinfectants.\n\n(a) Liquids used as deodorants or disinfectants in portable toilet and marine sanitation devices shall be compatible with septage and wastewater treatment plant.\n\n(b) Septage, including septage solids and filtrate, which has been mixed with liquids used as deodorants and disinfectants shall not be land applied.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1600) #13944, eff 4-27-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq1600.html"
